# Enemy_GasOrb_SpawnBossTripleJets: no corpus run calls it (ruling 5, 2). Its callers are the spawner
# longs at $046FF4 / $04701E in the Freeze fight scripts, the same calls that name its sibling
# Enemy_GasOrb_SpawnBossPairJets $043ACC with the same contract (d4/d5 the position, a4/a6 the
# caller's). The case runs at $043ACC's first call, so the state is one a Freeze script naming
# $043BA0 would leave (corpus-p6 2026-10-30).
at $043ACC

case as_boss_pair
